    "body": "I see. Pinging the various Mozilla people who have been involved, @bzbarsky @smaug---- @sicking, do you all think it's a good incremental step to make the setter non-`readonly`? This would allow you to set it to preexisting FileLists, as in @espadrine's examples, but would not provide a way to create a new FileList, and would not allow setting it to arrays or other iterables.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
